## IN POWERSHELL CREO IL CERTIFICATO

New-SelfSignedCertificate `
  -Type CodeSigning `
  -Subject "CN=DavideDaSerra" `
  -CertStoreLocation Cert:\CurrentUser\My

# esporto il certificato dal cert manager di windows

## LO CONVERTO IN BASE64
  [Convert]::ToBase64String(
  [IO.File]::ReadAllBytes("codesign.pfx")
) > cert.txt


IN GITHUB SECRETS
REPOSITORY -> SETTINGS -> SECRETS AND VARIABLES -> ACTIONS -> SECRETS

WINDOWS_CERTIFICATE ci metto il contenuto base64
WINDOWS_CERT_PASSWORD ci metto la password del cert PFX